<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Metrias Medical"
  description="How Metrias Medical collects, uses, and protects information on metriasmedical.com. This website does not collect protected health information (PHI)."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="June 6, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Metrias Medical, Inc.</strong> ("Metrias," "we,"
    "us") collects, uses, and protects information when you visit
    <strong>metriasmedical.com</strong> (the "Site"). It applies to the public marketing
    website only.
  </p>

  <h2>No patient information (PHI)</h2>
  <p>
    This Site does <strong>not</strong> collect protected health information (PHI). Please do
    not submit patient names, medical details, dates of birth, insurance information, or any
    other PHI through any form on this Site. Metrias handles PHI only under a separate, signed
    Business Associate Agreement (BAA) in the context of a paid engagement — never through this
    marketing website.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you provide</h3>
  <p>
    When you submit a contact or consultation form, we collect the information you enter:
    your name, email address, and — optionally — your role, organization, and the message you
    write. We use this only to respond to your inquiry.
  </p>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <p>
    We use privacy-conscious product analytics (PostHog) to understand how the Site is used —
    for example, pages viewed, approximate location derived from IP address, and device type.
    We configure analytics to create identified profiles only for visitors who submit a form.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your inquiry and schedule consultations.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and improve the Site.</li>
    <li>To detect and prevent spam and abuse.</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How information is shared</h2>
  <p>
    We do <strong>not</strong> sell personal information. We share information only with
    service providers who help us operate the Site, under contractual confidentiality
    obligations:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Attio</strong> — customer relationship management (storing your inquiry).</li>
    <li><strong>PostHog</strong> — product analytics.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, edge delivery, and anti-spam.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also disclose information where required by law.</p>

  <h2>Cookies & analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The Site uses a small number of cookies and similar technologies for analytics and
    security. Our analytics respect the "Do Not Track" browser signal. You can control cookies
    through your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain inquiry information for as long as needed to respond to you and to maintain a
    record of our communications, and otherwise as required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal information you have
    provided by emailing <a href="mailto:contact@metriasmedical.com">contact@metriasmedical.com</a>.
    Depending on your location, you may have additional rights under applicable privacy laws.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    We protect information in transit with encryption (TLS) and limit access to authorized
    personnel. For details on our broader security posture, see our
    <a href="/security">Security &amp; Compliance</a> page.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The Site is not directed to children under 18, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>International visitors</h2>
  <p>Information collected through the Site is processed and stored in the United States.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above reflects the most recent revision.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Metrias Medical, Inc. — <a href="mailto:contact@metriasmedical.com">contact@metriasmedical.com</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
